=== VERDICT ===
  In ERA5 the published criterion gives a DW-minus-NDW contrast of -0.682 of which 97% is the selection term. A pure surface shift of -0.636 sigma applied to event-free dates gives a 75% pass rate against 69% observed -- so 'about two thirds propagate downward' is what ONE shifted population produces, with no classes in it.

